description = "[PAWN_nameDef] traveled between planets, following news of animal attacks. [PAWN_pronoun] would camp on the planet for weeks, learning about [PAWN_possessive] prey before striking. [PAWN_pronoun] most enjoyed hunting thrumbos.\n\nPreferring to work alone, [PAWN_nameDef] enjoyed the thrill of the hunt, and the meat from the kill."
